{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t公務員事務局局長楊何蓓茵和公務員敍用委員會主席鄭美施約下午5時半在政府總部會見傳媒。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n公務員敍用委員會委員龔楊恩慈和黃冠文亦會一同出席。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:02:07.811076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:45:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:45.661838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:38.217197+00:00","content_hash":"c50a3bd3547d5a4b152718d4f5189631b27ecbee4c353dac5ab5001ce1c400f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}